WEBVTT

00:08.758 --> 00:10.034
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.137 --> 00:11.793
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:11.896 --> 00:13.310
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.413 --> 00:15.379
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.482 --> 00:18.551
- ♪ OHH...
- ♪ 噢...

00:18.655 --> 00:19.689
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.793 --> 00:22.689
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:22.793 --> 00:24.379
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.482 --> 00:26.413
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:26.517 --> 00:28.379
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:28.482 --> 00:30.310
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.413 --> 00:32.758
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.862 --> 00:33.689
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.793 --> 00:36.517
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:36.620 --> 00:38.241
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.344 --> 00:40.344
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.448 --> 00:41.620
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.724 --> 00:43.931
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:44.034 --> 00:46.448
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.551 --> 00:48.655
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:48.758 --> 00:50.172
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:04.413 --> 01:08.206
- [breathes deeply]
- [深呼吸]

01:08.310 --> 01:11.034
ANOTHER BEAUTIFUL SUNDAY
IN BIKINI BOTTOM.
又一个美丽的周日
比基尼下装。

01:11.137 --> 01:13.965
NOTHING CAN RUIN
MY GOOD MOOD TODAY.
没有什么可以破坏
我今天心情好。

01:14.068 --> 01:14.862
[door slams]
[关门声]

01:17.344 --> 01:19.793
- GOOD MORNING, SQUIDWARD.
- 早上好，章鱼哥。

01:19.896 --> 01:21.896
- ♪ IGNORING,
IGNORING ♪
- ♪ 忽略，
无视♪

01:22.000 --> 01:23.310
♪ LA DA-DUM DA-DA-DEE
DA-DA DOO ♪
♪ 拉达杜姆达达迪
哒哒哒♪

01:37.793 --> 01:38.758
squish!
压扁！

01:38.862 --> 01:40.482
WHOA!
OOF!
哇啊！
钱币！

01:41.586 --> 01:44.000
CHEWING GUM?
口香糖？

01:44.103 --> 01:45.862
THAT'S DISGUSTING.
太恶心了。

01:45.965 --> 01:47.758
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:47.862 --> 01:50.000
OH, COME ON.
哦，来吧。

01:50.103 --> 01:51.310
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:51.413 --> 01:52.206
slap!
拍击！

01:52.310 --> 01:54.172
OH!
[grunting]
哦！
[咕噜声]

01:54.275 --> 01:55.862
squish!
[grunting]
压扁！
[咕噜声]

01:55.965 --> 01:57.137
squish!
压扁！

01:57.241 --> 01:58.655
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:58.758 --> 02:00.689
squish!
[muttering]
压扁！
[嘀咕]

02:00.793 --> 02:02.931
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:03.034 --> 02:04.689
squish!
压扁！

02:04.793 --> 02:08.000
[screaming]
[尖叫]

02:08.103 --> 02:09.689
bang!
砰！

02:09.793 --> 02:12.689
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:16.275 --> 02:18.172
zing!
叮！

02:18.275 --> 02:20.758
PEOPLE THAT LITTER
REALLY BUG ME.
乱扔垃圾的人
真的让我烦恼。

02:20.862 --> 02:22.965
HUH, LITTER BUGS.
嗯，垃圾虫。

02:23.068 --> 02:24.206
[laughs]
[笑]

02:24.310 --> 02:25.172
LITTERBUGS.
[laughs]
乱扔垃圾。
[笑]

02:25.275 --> 02:26.310
splat!
啪！

02:29.206 --> 02:30.793
[gum squeaking]
[牙龈吱吱作响]

02:30.896 --> 02:32.206
- [sniffing]
- [嗅嗅]

02:32.310 --> 02:35.793
gulp!
[munching]
吞口水！
[咀嚼]

02:35.896 --> 02:37.344
[exhaling]
[呼气]

02:37.448 --> 02:38.379
pop!
流行音乐！

02:38.482 --> 02:39.931
slurp!
咕噜咕噜！

02:40.034 --> 02:41.172
LITTER.
垃圾。

02:42.896 --> 02:44.413
AHA!
啊哈！

02:44.517 --> 02:45.862
- [laughing]
BUGS.
- [笑]
错误。

02:45.965 --> 02:46.931
LITTER.
LITTERBUGS.
垃圾。
乱扔垃圾。

02:47.034 --> 02:48.137
- HEY, YOU,
- 嘿，你，

02:48.241 --> 02:49.689
DID YOU THROW THIS GUM AWAY?
你把口香糖扔掉了吗？

02:49.793 --> 02:51.068
- YES, I DID.
- 是的，我做到了。

02:51.172 --> 02:53.172
AND I'D LIKE TO COMPLAIN.
我想抱怨一下。

02:53.275 --> 02:55.655
- OH, SO YOU ADMIT
YOU'RE A LITTERBUG.
- 哦，所以你承认
你是个乱扔垃圾的人。

02:55.758 --> 02:56.965
- I DID--WHAT?
NO.
- 我做了--什么？
不。

02:57.068 --> 02:58.000
NO, NO,
I JUST STEPPED IN IT.
不，不，
我刚刚踏入其中。

02:58.103 --> 03:00.000
- OH, YOU SURE DID, BUDDY.
- 哦，你确实做到了，伙计。

03:00.103 --> 03:03.517
YOU DISGUST ME.
你让我恶心。

03:03.620 --> 03:04.620
squish!
压扁！

03:04.724 --> 03:05.448
snap!
折断！

03:05.551 --> 03:07.517
[pencil scratching]
[铅笔刮擦]

03:07.620 --> 03:09.655
MAYBE THIS WILL TEACH YOU
NOT TO TREAT THE WORLD
也许这会教你
不要对待世界

03:09.758 --> 03:12.034
AS YOUR OWN PERSONAL TRASH CAN.
作为您自己的个人垃圾桶。

03:12.137 --> 03:14.310
- [mutters]
"BIKINI BOTTOM P.D.
- [嘀咕]
“比基尼下装 P.D.

03:14.413 --> 03:15.827
"TICKET FOR LITTERING.
“乱扔垃圾罚单。

03:15.931 --> 03:18.655
PENALTY: COMMUNITY SERVICE"?
处罚：社区服务”？

03:23.068 --> 03:24.310
STUPID POLICEMAN.
愚蠢的警察。

03:24.413 --> 03:28.275
I'M NO LITTERBUG.
我不是垃圾虫。

03:28.379 --> 03:29.862
HEY, NO MORE TRASH.
嘿，不再有垃圾了。

03:29.965 --> 03:31.551
LOOKS LIKE I'M DONE.
看起来我已经完成了。

03:31.655 --> 03:34.241
- HERE, YOU CAN HAVE MINE.
- 在这里，你可以拥有我的。

03:34.344 --> 03:35.379
squish!
压扁！

03:35.482 --> 03:37.034
[cans clanking]
splat!
[罐头叮当作响]
啪！

03:37.137 --> 03:38.068
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

03:38.172 --> 03:40.310
CAN THINGS GET ANY WORSE?
事情还会变得更糟吗？

03:40.413 --> 03:42.827
- OF COURSE THEY CAN.
- 当然可以。

03:42.931 --> 03:46.482
- SQUILLIAM FANCYSON,
MY ARCH FOE FROM BAND CLASS!
- 史奎廉·范西森，
我乐队班的头号敌人！

03:46.586 --> 03:49.000
- STUCK DOING
COMMUNITY SERVICE, EH?
- 坚持做事
社区服务，嗯？

03:49.103 --> 03:50.586
COURT-ORDERED?
法庭命令？

03:50.689 --> 03:52.793
- NO, I--UM...
- 不，我--嗯...

03:52.896 --> 03:54.344
I'M VOLUNTEERING.
YEAH.
我正在做志愿者。
是的。

03:54.448 --> 03:56.931
I'M CLEANING UP BIKINI BOTTOM,
我正在清理比基尼泳裤

03:57.034 --> 04:00.551
SELFLESSLY DEVOTING MY TIME
TO A WORTHY CAUSE.
无私地奉献我的时间
为了一个值得的事业。

04:00.655 --> 04:01.896
- OOH!
- 哦！

04:02.000 --> 04:04.172
WELL, MAYBE IF YOU
CLEAN UP BIKINI BOTTOM,
好吧，也许如果你
清理比基尼底部，

04:04.275 --> 04:05.620
THEY'LL BUILD A STATUE OF YOU.
他们会为你建造一座雕像。

04:05.724 --> 04:07.620
OH, WAIT!
哦，等等！

04:07.724 --> 04:09.275
THEY'VE ALREADY BUILT ONE...
他们已经建造了一个......

04:09.379 --> 04:12.206
OF ME!
我的！

04:12.310 --> 04:13.827
I CLEANED UP
ALL OF BIKINI BOTTOM
我清理干净了
全部比基尼下装

04:13.931 --> 04:16.068
IN ONLY ONE WEEK.
仅一周时间。

04:16.172 --> 04:17.655
- BLESS YOU,
SQUILLIAM FANCYSON.
- 祝福你，
史奎廉·范西森。

04:17.758 --> 04:18.655
BLESS YOU.
祝福你。

04:18.758 --> 04:19.689
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

04:19.793 --> 04:21.172
HMPH!
哼！

04:21.275 --> 04:23.862
I'LL CLEAN UP BIKINI BOTTOM
IN A DAY.
我会清理比基尼底部
一天之内。

04:23.965 --> 04:25.620
- OH, LET ME HELP YOU OUT.
- 哦，让我来帮助你。

04:25.724 --> 04:28.137
[honking]
[鸣喇叭]

04:28.241 --> 04:29.206
[clears throat]
[清嗓子]

04:29.310 --> 04:30.344
THERE.
那里。

04:30.448 --> 04:32.517
THAT SHOULD GET YOU STARTED.
这应该可以帮助您开始。

04:32.620 --> 04:33.793
TA-TA!
TA-TA！
TA-TA！
塔塔！

04:36.413 --> 04:37.586
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

04:37.689 --> 04:38.689
UGH!
啊！

04:38.793 --> 04:39.793
rip!
smack!
撕裂！
咂！

04:43.827 --> 04:47.827
- SQUILLIAM THINKS
HE'S SO AMAZING.
- 史奎林认为
他太棒了。

04:53.724 --> 04:55.517
PHEW!
唷！

04:55.620 --> 04:58.517
HMM, I'VE GOT TO FIND SOMEWHERE
TO DUMP THIS LITTER.
嗯，我得找个地方
倒掉这个垃圾。

04:58.620 --> 05:00.586
OH, OH, OH!
PERFECT.
哦，哦，哦！
完美的。

05:00.689 --> 05:01.482
clang!
铛！

05:01.586 --> 05:02.586
[flies buzzing]
FULL!
[苍蝇嗡嗡声]
已满！

05:02.689 --> 05:03.344
clunk!
叮当！

05:03.448 --> 05:04.586
THEY'RE ALL FULL!
他们都满了！

05:04.689 --> 05:06.482
HOW AM I GONNA HAUL ALL THIS--
我该如何搬运这一切——

05:06.586 --> 05:10.000
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

05:12.275 --> 05:14.379
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

05:14.482 --> 05:16.206
WHOOPS!
UNH!
哎呀！
呃！

05:16.310 --> 05:19.103
[wheels squeaking]
- [whistling]
[车轮吱吱作响]
- [吹口哨]

05:19.206 --> 05:20.172
[door creaks open]
[门嘎吱一声打开]

05:20.275 --> 05:22.206
- OH, IS IT TRASH DAY?
- 哦，今天是垃圾日吗？

05:22.310 --> 05:23.965
I THOUGHT IT WAS TUESDAY.
我以为是星期二。

05:24.068 --> 05:25.344
- WHAT?
- 什么？

05:25.448 --> 05:26.551
NO!
thunk!
不！
咚！

05:26.655 --> 05:28.965
- HEY, EVERYBODY,
IT'S TRASH DAY!
- 嘿，大家，
今天是垃圾日！

05:29.068 --> 05:30.793
all: TRASH DAY?
所有人：垃圾日？

05:30.896 --> 05:32.206
- HEY, HOLD ON.
[crowd murmuring]
- 嘿，坚持住。
[人群窃窃私语]

05:32.310 --> 05:33.517
STOP!
停止！

05:33.620 --> 05:36.655
I'M NOT THE GARBAGEMAN!
我不是垃圾人！

05:36.758 --> 05:37.793
HELP.
帮助。

05:37.896 --> 05:40.103
[warbling]
pop!
[颤音]
噗！

05:40.206 --> 05:42.448
- HUH!
I'LL HELP YOU, SQUIDWARD.
- 哈！
我会帮助你，章鱼哥。

05:42.551 --> 05:44.172
- WHY ARE YOU
IN A TRASH BAG?
- 为什么是你
在垃圾袋里？

05:44.275 --> 05:45.551
- I WANTED TO STUDY
- 我想学习

05:45.655 --> 05:47.689
THE COMPLETE LIFE CYCLE
OF A KRABBY PATTY.
完整的生命周期
蟹肉饼。

05:47.793 --> 05:51.275
TSK, TSK.
ALL ALONE, POOR GUY.
TSK，TSK。
孤身一人，可怜的家伙。

05:51.379 --> 05:52.758
I COULD GET RID OF YOUR TRASH,
SQUIDWARD.
我可以处理掉你的垃圾，
章鱼哥。

05:52.862 --> 05:54.551
- NO, THANK YOU.
- 不，谢谢。

05:54.655 --> 05:56.379
I'LL DO IT MYSELF.
我自己来做。

05:58.241 --> 05:59.827
- PLEASE LET ME HELP.
- 请让我帮忙。

05:59.931 --> 06:00.965
- NO.
- PLEASE?
- 不。
- 请？

06:01.068 --> 06:01.793
- NO.
- PRETTY PLEASE?
- 不。
- 漂亮吗？

06:01.896 --> 06:03.103
- NO WAY!
- 决不！

06:03.206 --> 06:05.172
- PRETTY PLEASE
WITH CANDY SPRINKLES ON TOP?
- 拜托了
上面撒上糖果？

06:05.275 --> 06:06.655
- LISTEN CLOSELY.
- 仔细听。

06:06.758 --> 06:08.758
I DON'T NEED YOUR HELP.
我不需要你的帮助。

06:08.862 --> 06:11.482
I WOULD RATHER
BE BEATEN TO A PULP.
我宁愿
被打得稀巴烂。

06:11.586 --> 06:12.862
- THAT'S HIM, MOMMY.
- 那是他，妈妈。

06:12.965 --> 06:15.137
THAT'S THE MAN
WHO STOLE MY WAGON.
这就是那个男人
谁偷了我的马车。

06:15.241 --> 06:17.413
BEAT HIM TO A PULP!
把他打得稀巴烂！

06:17.517 --> 06:19.827
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

06:19.931 --> 06:21.827
- HI, LADY.
- 嗨，女士。

06:21.931 --> 06:24.068
[punches landing]
[出拳落地]

06:24.172 --> 06:26.482
[woman screaming]
[女人尖叫]

06:29.413 --> 06:30.275
[cans clinking]
[罐头叮当作响]

06:30.379 --> 06:33.344
[clinking and clanging]
[叮当作响]

06:33.448 --> 06:34.620
[wheels squeaking]
[车轮吱吱作响]

06:34.724 --> 06:35.517
squish!
squish!
压扁！
压扁！

06:38.862 --> 06:40.793
- UH-UH-UH-UH.
[pencil scratching]
- 呃-呃-呃-呃。
[铅笔刮擦]

06:40.896 --> 06:41.689
rip!
smack!
撕裂！
咂！

06:42.482 --> 06:44.034
- CAN I HELP YOU NOW?
- 我现在可以帮你吗？

06:44.137 --> 06:45.827
- ALL RIGHT, FINE.
- 好吧，好吧。

06:45.931 --> 06:46.931
YOU CAN HELP ME.
你可以帮助我。

06:47.034 --> 06:50.482
- YAY!
- 耶！

06:50.586 --> 06:51.655
THANK YOU, SQUIDWARD.
谢谢你，章鱼哥。

06:51.758 --> 06:53.413
- WELL, YOU GONNA HELP ME?
- 好吧，你要帮我吗？

06:53.517 --> 06:55.896
- FIRST, CLOSE YOUR EYES.
- 首先，闭上眼睛。

06:56.000 --> 06:56.896
- WHY?
- 为什么？

06:57.000 --> 06:57.931
- COME ON.
- 快点。

06:58.034 --> 06:59.103
- FINE.
- 美好的。

06:59.206 --> 07:00.896
NOW WHAT?
- NO PEEKING.
现在怎么办？
- 禁止偷看。

07:01.000 --> 07:02.379
- OH, BROTHER.
- 哦，兄弟。

07:02.482 --> 07:05.310
[rattling and whirring]
- [humming]
[嘎嘎声和呼呼声]
- [嗡嗡声]

07:05.413 --> 07:07.172
OKAY, YOU CAN
OPEN YOUR EYES NOW.
好的，你可以
现在睁开你的眼睛。

07:07.275 --> 07:10.000
- OH, THIS IS SO STU...
- 哦，这真是太棒了...

07:10.103 --> 07:12.103
PID.
PID。
PID。
PID。
PID。
PID。
PID。
PID。

07:12.206 --> 07:13.275
IT'S GONE!
不见了！

07:13.379 --> 07:14.517
WHERE DID YOU PUT THE TRASH?
你把垃圾放在哪里了？

07:14.620 --> 07:15.620
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

07:15.724 --> 07:17.379
I PUT IT IN--
我把它放进去——

07:17.482 --> 07:18.482
- KNOW WHAT?
DON'T CARE.
- 知道什么吗？
不在乎。

07:18.586 --> 07:20.172
THE TRASH IS GONE!
垃圾不见了！

07:20.275 --> 07:21.827
THANKS, SPONGEBOB.
谢谢，海绵宝宝。

07:21.931 --> 07:24.034
I HATE YOU A LITTLE LESS NOW.
我现在对你的恨少了一些。

07:24.137 --> 07:25.310
- SQUIDWARD, THAT--
- 章鱼哥，那个--

07:25.413 --> 07:27.000
THAT'S A BEAUTIFUL THING
TO SAY.
这是一件美好的事情
说。

07:30.965 --> 07:33.206
- WELL, I DON'T KNOW
HOW YOU DID IT,
- 嗯，我不知道
你是怎么做到的，

07:33.310 --> 07:35.931
BUT THANKS FOR GETTING RID
OF ALL THAT TRASH.
但谢谢你摆脱了
所有这些垃圾。

07:36.034 --> 07:39.068
THEY'LL HAVE THAT STATUE OF ME
BUILT IN NO TIME.
他们会有我的雕像
立即建成。

07:43.482 --> 07:46.482
[kettle whistling]
[水壶呼啸声]

07:46.586 --> 07:48.517
[clinking]
[叮叮当当]

07:48.620 --> 07:50.206
[slurping]
[发出声音]

07:50.310 --> 07:52.275
[smacking lips]
[sighs]
[咂嘴]
[叹气]

07:52.379 --> 07:54.000
boing!
噗！

07:54.103 --> 07:55.344
[squishing]
[压扁]

07:55.448 --> 07:57.379
[scraping]
[刮]

07:57.482 --> 07:59.862
[crunching]
[嘎吱嘎吱]

07:59.965 --> 08:02.586
[squeaking]
[吱吱声]

08:02.689 --> 08:04.103
[whooshing]
[呼啸]

08:04.206 --> 08:07.034
♪ LA DA-DEE LA DA-DUM
LA DA-DOO ♪
♪ 拉达迪 拉达杜姆
拉达杜♪

08:07.137 --> 08:08.344
[yawns]
[哈欠]

08:10.689 --> 08:11.586
[clanking]
[叮当声]

08:11.689 --> 08:13.896
[sighs]
[叹气]

08:14.000 --> 08:15.103
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

08:18.689 --> 08:21.620
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:23.344 --> 08:24.206
[gasps]
[喘气]

08:24.310 --> 08:25.586
MY HOUSE!
我的房子！

08:27.448 --> 08:28.793
- IS THIS YOURS?
- YES.
- 这是你的吗？
- 是的。

08:28.896 --> 08:30.482
[pencil scratching]
[铅笔刮擦]

08:30.586 --> 08:31.344
rip!
smack!
撕裂！
咂！

08:34.724 --> 08:37.724
[paper rustling]
[纸张沙沙作响]

08:39.724 --> 08:40.965
- TSK, TSK, TSK.
- TSK，TSK，TSK。
- TSK，TSK，TSK。
- TSK，TSK，TSK。
- TSK，TSK，TSK。
- TSK，TSK，TSK。
- TSK，TSK，TSK。
- TSK，TSK，TSK。

08:41.068 --> 08:43.931
SOME PEOPLE NEVER LEARN.
[pencil scratching]
有些人永远不会学习。
[铅笔刮擦]

08:44.034 --> 08:45.965
rip!
smack!
撕裂！
咂！

08:46.068 --> 08:48.965
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

08:53.103 --> 08:55.275
- "I AM ANGRY."
- “我很愤怒。”

08:55.379 --> 08:57.827
SQUIDWARD,
WHY ARE YOU ANGRY?
章鱼哥，
你为什么生气？

08:57.931 --> 08:59.000
smack!
咂！

09:01.827 --> 09:03.482
- SPONGEBOB...
- YES?
- 海绵宝宝...
- 是吗？

09:03.586 --> 09:04.551
- WHAT'S THIS?
- 这是什么？

09:04.655 --> 09:05.793
- YOUR GARBAGE.
- 你的垃圾。

09:05.896 --> 09:07.482
- WHERE'S MY HOUSE?
- 我的房子在哪里？

09:07.586 --> 09:10.172
- ON TOP OF YOUR GARBAGE.
- 在你的垃圾之上。

09:10.275 --> 09:11.310
THE DUMP WAS CLOSED.
垃圾场已关闭。

09:13.206 --> 09:14.586
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

09:14.689 --> 09:15.620
- SO I BROUGHT IT HERE.
- 所以我把它带到了这里。

09:15.724 --> 09:17.103
- H-HOW?
- 怎样？

09:17.206 --> 09:18.862
- LIKE THIS.
- 像这样。

09:20.103 --> 09:23.000
[gurgling]
[淙淙]

09:25.965 --> 09:27.000
thud!
砰！

09:28.965 --> 09:29.965
bang!
砰！

09:30.068 --> 09:32.034
[clanking]
[叮当声]

09:34.068 --> 09:35.275
[gasps]
[喘气]

09:35.379 --> 09:36.586
DO YOU WANT TO TRY?
你想尝试一下吗？

09:36.689 --> 09:38.379
squish!
压扁！

09:38.482 --> 09:41.000
- OF ALL THE GARBAGE
THAT COMES OUT OF YOUR MOUTH,
- 所有垃圾
从你嘴里说出来的，

09:41.103 --> 09:43.482
THIS IS THE LEAST ANNOYING.
这是最不烦人的。

09:43.586 --> 09:45.655
[laughing]
[笑]

09:50.275 --> 09:51.275
[pencil scratching]
[铅笔刮擦]

09:51.379 --> 09:53.206
rip!
smack!
撕裂！
咂！

09:53.310 --> 09:54.413
- HEY, SQUIDWARD!
- 嘿，章鱼哥！

09:54.517 --> 09:56.000
squish!
压扁！

09:59.758 --> 10:00.758
- WAIT. WAIT!
ZIP IT!
- 等待。等待！
压缩它！

10:00.862 --> 10:02.413
I HAVE AN IDEA.
我有一个主意。

10:07.586 --> 10:09.034
HERE.
STAND IN THIS.
这里。
坚持这一点。

10:12.448 --> 10:14.379
SEE YOU, SUCKER.
再见，傻瓜。

10:14.482 --> 10:17.896
[laughing]
[笑]

10:18.000 --> 10:20.000
- ARE YOU
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS?
- 你是吗
海绵宝宝？

10:20.103 --> 10:21.689
- NEPTUNE, NO.
- 海王星，NO。

10:23.034 --> 10:24.448
- UH-HUH.
- 呃哈。

10:24.551 --> 10:26.034
OH, YOU GET YOUR KICKS
哦，你得到你的踢

10:26.137 --> 10:28.448
OUT OF PUTTING TRASH
IN OTHER PEOPLE'S BINS, HUH?
不乱扔垃圾
在其他人的垃圾箱里，是吗？

10:28.551 --> 10:30.310
[pencil scratching]
[铅笔刮擦]

10:30.413 --> 10:31.137
rip!
smack!
撕裂！
咂！

10:38.310 --> 10:40.931
- THEY WERE GONNA
BUILD A STATUE OF ME.
- 他们会的
为我建造一座雕像。

10:41.034 --> 10:43.655
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

10:43.758 --> 10:46.482
- OH, A STATUE, EH?
- 哦，雕像，呃？

10:46.586 --> 10:48.034
[rattling and whirring]
[嘎嘎声和呼呼声]

10:48.137 --> 10:49.965
HEY, SQUIDWARD!
嘿，章鱼哥！

10:50.068 --> 10:51.724
LOOK!
看！

10:51.827 --> 10:53.206
- WHAT IS THAT?
- 那是什么？

10:53.310 --> 10:55.689
- YOUR VERY OWN STATUE!
- 你自己的雕像！

10:55.793 --> 10:57.310
- [gasps]
REALLY?
- [喘气]
真的吗？

11:02.517 --> 11:03.517
GARBAGE.
垃圾。

11:03.620 --> 11:05.689
I'M MADE OF GARBAGE.
我是垃圾做的。

11:05.793 --> 11:07.068
- YOU SURE ARE.
- 你确实是。

11:07.172 --> 11:09.206
- [laughing]
- [笑]

11:09.310 --> 11:11.000
GREAT JOB, SPONGEBOB.
干得好，海绵宝宝。

11:11.103 --> 11:13.344
YOU EVEN CAPTURED HIS SMELL:
你甚至闻到了他的气味：

11:13.448 --> 11:16.103
THE SCENT OF FAILURE.
失败的气息。

11:21.137 --> 11:22.034
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

11:22.137 --> 11:24.344
[gurgling]
[淙淙]

11:24.448 --> 11:27.793
MY GLORIOUS STATUE!
我光荣的雕像！

11:27.896 --> 11:29.551
- THIS IS YOUR STATUE?
- 这是你的雕像吗？

11:29.655 --> 11:31.103
- IT WAS.
[pencil scratching]
- 是的。
[铅笔刮擦]

11:31.206 --> 11:33.551
rip!
smack!
撕裂！
咂！

11:33.655 --> 11:35.827
- [laughs]
- [笑]

11:35.931 --> 11:37.620
THANKS, SPONGEBOB.
谢谢，海绵宝宝。

11:37.724 --> 11:38.827
- [clears throat]
- [清喉咙]

11:40.517 --> 11:42.586
[rattling]
[嘎嘎声]

11:42.689 --> 11:44.068
[pencil scratching]
[铅笔刮擦]

11:44.172 --> 11:45.275
rip!
smack!
撕裂！
咂！

11:45.379 --> 11:46.103
rip!
squeak!
撕裂！
吱！

12:04.344 --> 12:06.862
squish!
压扁！

12:06.965 --> 12:07.931
crash!
碰撞！

12:08.034 --> 12:09.827
[clanging]
[叮叮当当]

12:09.931 --> 12:10.965
snap!
折断！

12:11.068 --> 12:12.103
[thudding]
[重击]

12:12.206 --> 12:13.068
smack!
咂！

12:13.172 --> 12:13.310
squeak!
吱！

12:15.379 --> 12:16.896
- [meows]
- [喵]

12:17.000 --> 12:17.931
- [laughs]
- [笑]

12:18.034 --> 12:18.965
OKAY, GARE.
好的，火车站。

12:19.068 --> 12:21.793
I'LL GET OUT OF YOUR HAIR.
我会离开你的头发。

12:21.896 --> 12:23.241
ding!
叮！

12:23.344 --> 12:24.448
[rattles]
[摇铃]

12:24.551 --> 12:26.275
SEE YOU LATER, GARE.
再见，火车站。

12:26.379 --> 12:28.482
OH, YOU WANT TO GO
FOR A WALK.
哦，你想去
散步。

12:28.586 --> 12:32.206
SORRY, BUDDY, I DON'T HAVE TIME
FOR A WALK RIGHT NOW.
抱歉，伙计，我没有时间
现在就去散步。

12:32.310 --> 12:34.655
GOT TO GET OVER
TO THE OLD JOB.
必须克服
回到原来的工作。

12:34.758 --> 12:36.965
YOU'LL JUST HAVE TO STAY HERE
ALONE, LITTLE BUDDY.
你只需要留在这里
独自一人，小伙伴。

12:37.068 --> 12:38.310
BUT I PROMISE,
但我保证，

12:38.413 --> 12:40.275
AS SOON AS I GET HOME,
WE'LL HAVE FUN...
我一回到家，
我们会玩得很开心...

12:40.379 --> 12:41.517
TOGETHER.
一起。

12:41.620 --> 12:43.448
OKAY.
好的。

12:43.551 --> 12:45.793
LOVE YOU, GARE BEAR.
爱你，盖尔熊。

12:45.896 --> 12:46.965
BYE.
再见。

13:00.034 --> 13:01.758
[country and western music]
[乡村和西部音乐]

13:01.862 --> 13:03.551
[horse whinnying]
[马嘶声]

13:03.655 --> 13:04.689
POOR LITTLE SNAIL,
可怜的小蜗牛，

13:04.793 --> 13:06.482
JUST WANTED SOME FUN TIME.
只是想要一些有趣的时间。

13:06.586 --> 13:08.034
I CAN ONLY IMAGINE
我只能想象

13:08.137 --> 13:10.862
THE TORTURED LONELINESS
HE MUST BE FEELING RIGHT NOW.
备受折磨的孤独
他现在一定有感觉。

13:10.965 --> 13:12.724
- [laughs]
- [笑]

13:14.413 --> 13:17.103
[broom rustling]
[扫帚沙沙作响]

13:17.206 --> 13:18.344
[door clicks open]
[门咔哒一声打开]

13:18.448 --> 13:20.172
- WELCOME TO THE KRU--
- [barking]
- 欢迎来到克鲁--
- [吠叫]

13:20.275 --> 13:21.551
- SORRY, SIR,
BUT THE KRUSTY KRAB
- 对不起，先生，
但是脆皮蟹

13:21.655 --> 13:24.068
HAS A STRICT NO-PET POLICY.
制定严格的禁止携带宠物政策。

13:24.172 --> 13:26.275
I'M AFRAID YOUR WORM
WILL HAVE TO WAIT OUTSIDE.
我害怕你的蠕虫
必须在外面等待。

13:26.379 --> 13:28.586
- OH, I COULD NEVER DO THAT.
- 哦，我永远做不到。

13:28.689 --> 13:31.413
HE GETS FAR TOO LONELY AND UPSET
WHEN HE'S LEFT ALONE.
他变得太孤独和沮丧
当他独自一人时。

13:31.517 --> 13:33.000
SORRY, BUDDY.
对不起，伙计。

13:33.103 --> 13:34.931
I GUESS I CAN'T BUY YOU
THAT KRABBY PATTY YOU WANTED.
我想我买不到你
您想要的蟹肉饼。

13:35.034 --> 13:37.206
LET'S JUST GO HOME.
我们回家吧。

13:37.310 --> 13:37.965
- EH?
-呃？

13:38.068 --> 13:38.931
HEY-HEY-HEY!
嘿嘿嘿！

13:39.034 --> 13:41.068
LET'S NOT BE HASTY.
我们不要操之过急。

13:41.172 --> 13:43.655
NOW, WHY DIDN'T YOU JUST SAY
现在，你为什么不直接说

13:43.758 --> 13:45.724
YOU WERE BUYING YOUR PET
A KRABBY PATTY?
您正在购买您的宠物
蟹肉饼？

13:45.827 --> 13:47.172
LISTEN, I'LL TELL YOU WHAT.
听着，我告诉你什么。

13:47.275 --> 13:48.517
FOR YOUR TROUBLES,
为了您的烦恼，

13:48.620 --> 13:52.379
I'LL GIVE YOU TWO KRABBY PATTIES
AT REGULAR PRICE.
我给你两个蟹肉饼
按正常价格。

13:52.482 --> 13:53.689
[chuckles]
[笑声]

13:53.793 --> 13:55.034
SPONGEBOB,
海绵宝宝，

13:55.137 --> 13:58.517
GIVE THIS RESPONSIBLE PET OWNER
TWO KRABBY PATTIES.
给这位负责任的宠物主人
两个蟹肉饼。

13:58.620 --> 14:00.551
- [meows]
- RESPONSIBLE PET OWNER.
- [喵]
- 负责任的宠物主人。

14:00.655 --> 14:03.758
I LEAVE GARY HOME
BY HIMSELF EVERY DAY.
我把加里留在家里
每天都是他自己。

14:03.862 --> 14:05.413
I'D BETTER CALL HIM
AND MAKE SURE HE'S OKAY.
我最好给他打电话
并确保他没事。

14:05.517 --> 14:08.689
[phone rings]
[电话铃声]

14:08.793 --> 14:10.689
TOO DISTRAUGHT
TO EVEN ANSWER THE PHONE.
太心烦意乱
甚至接电话。

14:10.793 --> 14:13.241
HELLO, YOU'VE REACHED
SPONGEBOB AND--
您好，您已到达
海绵宝宝和——

14:13.344 --> 14:14.862
COME ON, GARY--
- [meows]
来吧，加里——
- [喵]

14:14.965 --> 14:16.655
- GARY.
[laughs]
- 加里。
[笑]

14:16.758 --> 14:19.103
THE TWO OF US ARE HAVING
TOO MUCH FUN TOGETHER
我们两个人正在
在一起太有趣了

14:19.206 --> 14:20.655
TO ANSWER THE PHONE RIGHT NOW,
要立即接听电话，

14:20.758 --> 14:22.620
SO LEAVE A MESSAGE,
AND WE'LL CALL YOU RIGHT BACK
所以请留言，
我们会立即给您回电

14:22.724 --> 14:24.827
IF WE EVER GET A BREAK
FROM HAVING SO MUCH FUN...
如果我们休息一下
享受如此多的乐趣...

14:24.931 --> 14:26.241
TOGETHER!
一起！

14:26.344 --> 14:27.275
[both laugh]
beep!
[两人都笑了]
嘟！

14:27.379 --> 14:29.344
MY OUTGOING MESSAGE IS A LIE.
我发出的消息是谎言。

14:29.448 --> 14:30.689
GARY, ARE YOU THERE?
加里，你在吗？

14:30.793 --> 14:32.448
GARY, IT'S SPONGEBOB.
JUST CHECKING IN.
加里，这是海绵宝宝。
刚刚办理入住。

14:32.551 --> 14:34.103
IF YOU'RE THERE, PICK UP.
- [laughing]
如果您在那里，请接机。
- [笑]

14:34.206 --> 14:36.413
- I KNOW YOU'RE FEELING
REAL LONELY RIGHT NOW.
- 我知道你的感受
现在真的很孤独。

14:36.517 --> 14:37.965
JUST HANG IN THERE, GARY.
坚持住，加里。

14:38.068 --> 14:38.206
DADDY'LL BE HOME SOON.
爸爸很快就会回来。

14:48.034 --> 14:49.344
- WELL, WELL, WELL.
- 好吧，好吧，好吧。

14:49.448 --> 14:51.551
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

14:51.655 --> 14:54.344
WHAT A STROKE OF LUCK,
YOU COMING BY LIKE THIS.
多么幸运啊，
你就这样过来了。

14:54.448 --> 14:56.689
I WAS JUST ABOUT
TO RE-TAR THE PARKING LOT.
我刚刚
重新柏油停车场。

14:56.793 --> 14:58.137
WHY DON'T YOU GRAB A SHOVEL?
你为什么不拿把铲子呢？

14:58.241 --> 15:00.931
- MR. KRABS, I'D LOVE
TO RE-TAR THE PARKING LOT,
- 先生。螃蟹，我喜欢
要重新柏油停车场，

15:01.034 --> 15:02.862
BUT I'VE GOT
A LONELY PET SNAIL AT HOME,
但我有
家里一只孤独的宠物蜗牛，

15:02.965 --> 15:06.344
AND TECHNICALLY, MY SHIFT
WAS OVER FIVE HOURS AGO.
从技术上讲，我的转变
五个多小时前。

15:06.448 --> 15:09.068
- OH, SAY NO MORE, KID.
- 哦，别再说了，孩子。

15:09.172 --> 15:12.551
YOU GET ON HOME
TO YOUR PET TURTLE OR WHATEVER.
你回家了
对于您的宠物乌龟或其他任何东西。

15:12.655 --> 15:13.448
RIGHT NOW.
GO!
现在。
去！

15:13.551 --> 15:14.655
- REALLY, MR. KRABS?
- 真的，先生。螃蟹？

15:14.758 --> 15:15.793
YOU'LL LET ME DO THAT?
你会让我这么做吗？

15:15.896 --> 15:17.379
- SURE.
- 当然。

15:17.482 --> 15:19.103
JUST COME IN
FIVE HOURS EARLY TOMORROW
进来吧
明天早五小时

15:19.206 --> 15:20.379
TO FINISH THE PARKING LOT.
完成停车场。

15:20.482 --> 15:22.172
- YOU'RE THE BEST, MR. KRABS!
- 你是最棒的，先生。螃蟹！

15:23.862 --> 15:25.241
POOR GARY'S BEEN HOME ALONE
ALL DAY.
可怜的加里独自在家
一整天。

15:25.344 --> 15:27.758
HOW AM I GONNA KEEP HIM HAPPY
我怎样才能让他开心

15:27.862 --> 15:30.793
AND TEND TO MY RESPONSIBILITIES
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB?
并履行我的责任
在 Krusty Krab 吗？

15:30.896 --> 15:33.758
- WOW, DAD,
IS IT REALLY MINE TO KEEP?
- 哇，爸爸，
它真的是我的吗？

15:33.862 --> 15:35.206
- YEP.
- 是的。

15:35.310 --> 15:37.931
NOW YOU HAVE A FURRY FRIEND
TO KEEP YOU FROM FEELING LONELY.
现在你有一个毛茸茸的朋友了
让您不再感到孤独。

15:38.034 --> 15:39.827
screech!
- HUH?
尖叫！
- 嗯？

15:39.931 --> 15:43.068
- AND NOW DADDY CAN GO ON HIS
BUSINESS TRIPS GUILT-FREE.
- 现在爸爸可以继续他的了
商务旅行无负罪感。

15:43.172 --> 15:46.862
- MAYHAP IF I GOT GARY
A PAL HE COULD PLAY WITH,
- 如果我有加里也许会
一个可以和他一起玩的朋友，

15:46.965 --> 15:49.000
HE WON'T BE SO LONELY
WHEN I'M AT WORK.
他不会那么孤独
当我工作时。

15:49.103 --> 15:50.551
- GEE, THANKS, DAD.
- 哎呀，谢谢，爸爸。

15:52.275 --> 15:53.482
- THEY'RE SO PRECIOUS.
- 它们是如此珍贵。

15:53.586 --> 15:56.000
[creatures chittering]
[生物叽叽喳喳]

15:56.103 --> 15:56.896
SOLD!
卖！

15:57.000 --> 15:58.448
I'LL TAKE THAT ONE RIGHT THERE.
我就在那儿拿一个。

15:58.551 --> 15:59.896
- YOU WISH TO OBTAIN
- 您希望获得

16:00.000 --> 16:02.448
ONE OF MY RARE
AND EXTREMELY DANGEROUS--
我稀有的之一
并且极其危险——

16:02.551 --> 16:03.482
HUH?
嗯？

16:03.586 --> 16:05.413
- OH, YEAH, THIS IS THE ONE.
- 哦，是的，就是这个。

16:05.517 --> 16:08.724
- BEWARE, BOY.
THIS IS NO ORDINARY PET.
- 小心，男孩。
这不是普通的宠物。

16:08.827 --> 16:10.344
- [giggles]
GARY'S GONNA BE SO HAPPY.
- [咯咯笑]
加里会很高兴的。

16:10.448 --> 16:11.965
- YOU MUST UNDERSTAND,
- 你必须明白，

16:12.068 --> 16:14.896
THESE CREATURES
CAN BE VERY UNSTABLE,
这些生物
可能非常不稳定，

16:15.000 --> 16:16.896
ESPECIALLY AROUND OTHER PETS.
特别是在其他宠物周围。

16:17.000 --> 16:20.413
[cat meows]
- [growls and barks ferociously]
[猫喵喵叫]
- [凶猛地咆哮和吠叫]

16:20.517 --> 16:21.551
- YEAH, YEAH, YEAH,
THANKS, BYE!
- 是啊，是啊，是啊，
谢谢，再见！

16:21.655 --> 16:23.413
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

16:23.517 --> 16:25.000
- WHY BOTHER?
- 为什么要麻烦？

16:25.103 --> 16:27.310
THEY NEVER LISTEN.
